        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_709_1743.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich willig dienst, sambt was wir eren liebs
<lb n="2"/>und guots vermoegent zuovor, fromm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtig</unclear> wyß in-
<lb n="3"/>sonders guot fründ und getrüw lieb Eydtgnossen, uff
<lb n="4"/>unser nechst schryben und berichten, dero von <placeName resp="#ner">Magdeburg</placeName>
<lb n="5"/>werbung halb. Ist dero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsannndter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="6"/>syner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürtrag</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschrifftlich</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müntlich</unclear> gethan. Als
<lb n="7"/>wir unns achten, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wöllichem</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>wir mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzügiger</unclear> antwurt begegnet, Und also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwart</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnosischer</unclear> tag ge-
<lb n="10"/>halten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würde</unclear>, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uewer</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fünff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stetten</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anmoecht</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sach</unclear> halb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitenandern</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eyner</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>antwurt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underreden</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beratschlagen</unclear> söllen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> zyt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demaß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verluffen</unclear>, das
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kheyns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölichen</unclear> tags, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">osteren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fasten</unclear> (daruff sich
<lb n="15"/>üwer und unser lieb Eydtgnossen von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ant</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurten</unclear> erpotten.) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vergwüst</unclear>, Und dann das wir von
<lb n="17"/>den stetten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> sachen wegen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuosamen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>komen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> nit für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> ansehen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>, So
<lb n="19"/>habent wir sampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerli</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruerter</unclear> von
<lb n="20"/><placeName resp="#ner">Magdeburg</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begären</unclear> für uns genomen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wölliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>eygentlich bedacht und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwegen</unclear>. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedenk</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/>ung, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allerley</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eehaffter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwerligkeiten</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursachen</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/>denen von Magdeburg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuchen</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lichung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tusent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guldinen</unclear> nit willfaren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sonders</unclear> werden uff
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künfftige</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-16" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Franckfurter</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vastenmeß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eynen</unclear> antwurt
<lb n="26"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzoellung</unclear>, was uns zum abschlag bewegt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschrifft</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>lich hinab fertigen, und uns uff das best <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entschuldigen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedencken</unclear> sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> benuegig und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuofriden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> söllint.
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> entschluß und antwurt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glych</unclear> wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> üwern, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> lieben Eydtgnossen
<lb n="31"/>von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schaffhusen</placeName> uff unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgehan</unclear> schryben,
<lb n="32"/>zuo bericht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uonangetzeyt</unclear> nit lassen, dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>lieben Eydtgnossen lieb und dienst zuo bewysen sind wir
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzyt</unclear> gantz geneygt und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1552" cert="medium" resp="#ner">mit-
<lb n="35"/>wuchen den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">xxiij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Februarij</unclear> anno etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lij</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="36"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_709_1744.JPG" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_709_1745.JPG" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_709_1746.JPG" n="4"/>
<lb n="38"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fürsichtigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger=
<lb n="39"/>meyster unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßern</unclear> besonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> fründen und
<lb n="41"/>getrüwen lieben Eydtgnossen,
</p>
